# IntelliJ HTTP Client (or copy bodies to Postman).
# 1. Replace @token after running login.
# 2. Seed IDs below work only after database/02_seed.sql is imported.
@base = http://localhost:8080/api/v1
@token = REPLACE_JWT_FROM_LOGIN
@course = 20000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001
@rubric = 50000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001
@question = 60000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000006
@exam = 70000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001

### Lecturer login: response has accessToken
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"lecturer@aives.local","password":"Demo@123456"}

### List my courses
GET {{base}}/courses
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Module 1: List rubric of course
GET {{base}}/courses/{{course}}/rubrics
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Module 1: List question bank
GET {{base}}/courses/{{course}}/questions?status=PENDING_REVIEW
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Module 1: Create draft manual question
POST {{base}}/courses/{{course}}/questions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "Giải thích sự khác biệt giữa REST và SOAP?",
  "referenceAnswer": "REST là một kiểu kiến trúc, SOAP là một giao thức...",
  "bloomLevel": "UNDERSTAND",
  "difficulty": "MEDIUM",
  "topicId": "30000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
  "rubricId": "50000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001"
}

### Module 1: Review existing PENDING_REVIEW demo question
POST {{base}}/courses/{{course}}/questions/{{question}}/review
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"decision":"APPROVE","comment":"Đạt yêu cầu."}

### Module 2: List exams in course
GET {{base}}/courses/{{course}}/exams
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Module 2: Add question to a new DRAFT exam (not the seeded SCHEDULED exam)
# POST {{base}}/exams/REPLACE_DRAFT_EXAM_ID/questions/60000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001

### Student login (use returned JWT for student routes)
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"student1@aives.local","password":"Demo@123456"}

### Module 2: My scheduled exams (requires STUDENT token)
GET {{base}}/exams/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Module 3: Existing transcript from demo completed attempt (requires STUDENT token)
GET {{base}}/attempts/81000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/turns
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Module 3: Start the demo scheduled exam (only works DURING your assigned slot)
# POST {{base}}/exams/{{exam}}/attempts/start
